    "description": "On the right, the flower of the arrayán accompanied by the year of coinage \"2017\". In the upper arch, the motto \"EN UNION Y LIBERTAD\". The location of the denomination \"5 PESOS\" indicates the Patagonia, region where this species is more representative.",
